<view class="screen"><view class="mode-banner">{{modeLabel}}</view><view wx:if="{{imageError}}" class="note">部分图片暂时无法读取，请稍后刷新。商品和订单信息以文字为准。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取好物…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{loading}}">重新读取</button><button class="text-button" data-page="mine" bindtap="go">前往我的</button></view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><text class="eyebrow">SIMULATED CHECKOUT</text><text class="page-title">确认这一份家乡味</text><view wx:if="{{hasPending}}" class="note">有一笔结果待确认的下单请求。继续确认会使用原编号，不会重复扣库存。请先核对结果，再创建其他订单。</view><view class="surface"><text class="heading">示例收货地区</text><picker range="{{addresses}}" range-key="label" value="{{addressIndex}}" bindchange="address" disabled="{{hasPending || processing}}"><view class="address-box"><text class="product-title">{{addresses[addressIndex].label}}　⌄</text><text class="body-copy">{{addresses[addressIndex].person}} · {{addresses[addressIndex].phone}}</text><text class="muted small">{{addresses[addressIndex].address}}</text></view></picker><text class="note">本轮只使用示例地址，无需填写真实姓名、电话。</text></view><view class="surface"><text class="heading">订单里的好物</text><view wx:for="{{quote.lines}}" wx:key="key" class="order-product"><image binderror="imageFailed" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="grow"><text class="product-title">{{item.product}}</text><text class="muted small">{{item.variantLabel}} · {{item.weight}}</text><text class="body-copy">¥{{item.priceText}} × {{item.quantity}}</text></view></view><view class="info-row"><text>商品小计</text><text>¥{{quote.subtotalText}}</text></view><view class="info-row"><text>模拟运费</text><text>¥{{quote.shippingText}}</text></view><view class="info-row"><text>模拟合计</text><text class="price">¥{{quote.totalText}}</text></view></view><view class="note">生成订单会扣减模拟可售库存。无支付、真实配送或退款。</view><view class="fixed-actions"><view class="grow"><text class="small muted">实际付款 ¥0.00</text><text class="price">¥{{quote.totalText}}<text class="small">（模拟）</text></text></view><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{processing}}" disabled="{{processing}}">{{hasPending ? '确认上次下单结果' : '生成模拟订单'}}</button></view></view><view class="bottom-space"></view></view>
